                        "entry_id": "a894b9dc-2429-3e4b-a29a-f4ab77494603",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An Ancient Scandinavian public meeting for passing judgement and making group decisions; thing (public assembly or judicial council in a Germanic country)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a09278d1-fc48-44eb-9476-8ea7229c1a05",
                                "sense_id": "33c0231e-61c1-3e9c-b266-8c0781edc0cc",
                                "text": "The third root of ash is in heaven, and beneath it is the most sacred fountain of Urd. Here the gods have their doomstead."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "07425f40-2766-44fa-a184-f471b25ffffa",
                                "sense_id": "33c0231e-61c1-3e9c-b266-8c0781edc0cc",
                                "text": "And the plaintiff shall set his doom over against [that of] the defendant after a space of five nights at the proper doomstead, whether he [the defendant] is there or not; and let the doom be set and held and let the men wait till midday. And when the midday is past, the plaintiff shall summon the defendant to a wager doom at the proper doomstead after a space of five nights."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eace87cf-5702-4276-be7e-7cfef0923dc7",
                                "sense_id": "33c0231e-61c1-3e9c-b266-8c0781edc0cc",
                                "text": "There were many gardens and many gods with a central home or doomstead where judgment was given to all the gods and where they swore allegiance as mentioned in the story of the island of Poseidon."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
